direction: down
classes: {
  app: {style.border-radius: 12; style.bold: true}
  files: {shape: document}
  data: {shape: cylinder}
}
source: Upstream system\nAssesses immunization status {class: app}
csv: CSV + notice selections {class: data}
source -> csv
Template: ImmuKnow Template\nStarter notices + settings\nReference lists {class: app}
project: Authored notice project\nTemplates · config · branding {class: files}
Template -> project
Studio: ImmuKnow Studio\nBrowser editing + previews {class: app}
project <-> Studio: import / export files
Core: ImmuKnow Core\nNative production processing {class: app}
project -> Core: local project files
csv -> Core: supplied facts and choices
outputs: PDFs · bundles · reports\nReview before delivery {shape: package}
Core -> outputs
resources: Core library + schemas\nCopy intact at setup {class: files}
resources -> project
